  "title": "Lobster Newberg",
  "description": "Lobster tails are sautéed in butter and mixed with a simple cream sauce to make Chef John's take on the classic dish Lobster Newberg. Serve over toast or as lobster puffs in puff pastry.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
